### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 仪表盘
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard

### 数字孪生数据
GET http://localhost:8080/api/warehouse/twin

### 商品列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 入库推荐
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound/recommend
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"quantity":20}

### 入库确认
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inbound/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"quantity":20,"shelfId":2}

### 创建出库订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/outbound/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"quantity":5}

### 扫描预警
POST http://localhost:8080/api/warnings/scan

### AI 问答
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"哪些商品需要补货？"}

### 修改仓库存储类型：只有仓库主管 user_permission=0 可以修改
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/warehouse/1/storage-type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storageType": "贵重物品",
  "operatorUserId": 1
}
